<Base title="About — Will">
  <section class="about wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>A person before a profile.</h1>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <p>I’m Will. I’m currently a student, and most of my work lives somewhere around AI, scientific computing, physical systems, and whatever new problem I become curious enough to investigate.</p>
        <p>I like research, but I don’t want this website to pretend that research is the whole person. I also care a lot about music, books, films, storytelling, and the small pieces of culture that end up becoming part of how we understand ourselves.</p>
        <p>I made this site partly because I wanted one place that could hold all of those things without forcing them into the shape of a résumé.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="facts">
        <div><span>Based</span><strong>Shanghai / elsewhere</strong></div>
        <div><span>Studying</span><strong>AI, science & physical systems</strong></div>
        <div><span>Usually listening to</span><strong>something too many times</strong></div>
        <div><span>Contact</span><strong><a href="https://github.com/Hydr0g3ngz">GitHub · @Hydr0g3ngz</a></strong></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
